## 🎴 Cards (Most Commonly Used)

**Location:** `lib/core/widgets/cards/`

### 1. `InfoCard` ⭐ PRIMARY CARD
**Use for:** Category listings, action cards, feature highlights, most content cards

```dart
import 'package:learn/core/widgets/cards/info_card.dart';

InfoCard(
  title: 'Past Questions',
  subtitle: 'Access 1000+ past exam papers',
  leading: Container(/* Icon badge */),
  trailing: SvgIcons.chevronRight(size: 16),
  backgroundImage: 'https://...',  // Optional
  showBar: true,  // Vertical accent bar
  isPageSection: true, // Auto-wraps in PageSection (horizontal padding)
  onTap: () => Navigator.push(...),
)
```

**Features:**
- Vertical accent bar (branding)
- Background image support (faded right)
- Leading icon badge
- Trailing action chevron
- **Adaptive Padding:** Use `isPageSection: true` (default) for standalone sections. Set to `false` when placing inside a `Column` or `ListView` that already has horizontal padding.
- Auto light/dark mode

