## 💬 Dialogs & Modals

**Location:** `lib/core/widgets/dialogs/`

### 1. `AppBottomSheet` ⭐ ALWAYS USE THIS
**NEVER use `showDialog` or raw `showModalBottomSheet`**

```dart
import 'package:learn/core/widgets/dialogs/app_bottom_sheet.dart';

AppBottomSheet.show(
  context: context,
  title: 'Options',
  titleIcon: Icons.settings,
  content: Column(
    mainAxisSize: MainAxisSize.min,
    children: [
      AppBottomSheetListItem(
        leading: SvgIcons.edit(size: 20),
        title: 'Edit',
        subtitle: 'Modify this item',
        onTap: () {},
      ),
      AppBottomSheetDivider(),
      AppBottomSheetListItem(
        leading: SvgIcons.delete(size: 20),
        title: 'Delete',
        onTap: () {},
      ),
    ],
  ),
);
```

### 2. `AppDeleteConfirmationSheet`
**Use for:** Delete confirmations

```dart
import 'package:learn/core/widgets/dialogs/app_delete_confirmation_sheet.dart';

AppDeleteConfirmationSheet.show(
  context,
  title: 'Delete Course',
  message: 'This cannot be undone',
  onConfirm: () => _handleDelete(),
  isLoading: state.isDeleting,
)
```

### 3. `AppDialog`
**Use for:** Important confirmations, warnings

```dart
import 'package:learn/core/widgets/dialogs/app_dialog.dart';

AppDialog.show(
  context: context,
