## 🚨 Common Mistakes to Avoid

### ❌ DON'T Create Custom Cards
```dart
// ❌ BAD
Container(
  decoration: BoxDecoration(/* Custom styling */),
  child: /* Custom card content */,
)
```

### ✅ DO Use Existing Cards
```dart
// ✅ GOOD
InfoCard(
  title: 'Title',
  subtitle: 'Description',
  onTap: () {},
)
```

### ❌ DON'T Use showDialog
```dart
// ❌ BAD
showDialog(
  context: context,
  builder: (context) => AlertDialog(...),
)
```

### ✅ DO Use AppBottomSheet
```dart
// ✅ GOOD
AppBottomSheet.show(
  context: context,
  title: 'Title',
  content: /* Content */,
)
```

### ❌ DON'T Create Custom Loaders
```dart
// ❌ BAD
Center(child: CircularProgressIndicator())
```

### ✅ DO Use AppLoader
```dart
// ✅ GOOD
AppLoader()
```

