## 📚 Widget Selection Guide

### "I need to display..."

**...a clickable card with title & description:**
→ `InfoCard` or `IconListCard`

**...a grid of action buttons:**
→ `ActionGridCard`

**...statistics/metrics:**
→ `StatCard`

**...a list item:**
→ `IconListCard` or `ListItem`

**...a modal/sheet:**
→ `AppBottomSheet` (ALWAYS)

**...a page header:**
→ `AppPremiumHeader` (ALWAYS)

**...a search bar:**
→ `AppSearchBar`

**...a loading indicator:**
→ `AppLoader`

**...an empty state:**
→ `EmptyState`

**...an error message:**
→ `AppErrorDisplay`

**...a button:**
→ `AppButton` or `ActionButton`

**...a filter/chip:**
→ `AppFilterChip`

